  "properties": {
    "title": "Last of the Wild Project, Version 3 (LWP-3): 2009 Human Footprint, 2018 Release",
    "description": "The 2009 Human Footprint, 2018 Release provides a global map of the cumulative human pressure on the environment in 2009, at a spatial resolution of ~1 km. The human pressure is measured using eight variables including built-up environments, population density, electric power infrastructure, crop lands, pasture lands, roads, railways, and navigable waterways. The data set is produced by Venter et.al., and is available in the Mollweide projection.",
